14	/**
15	 * Normalizes the address a generated site is published at.
16	 *
17	 * The site itself links relatively and needs no address, so this is only
18	 * read by what has to name a page from outside the site: the social
19	 * preview tags a link shared elsewhere is rendered from, and the canonical
20	 * link that says which of several deployments is the documented one.
